    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d221">

                <pb facs="0261" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg251"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.48/1408: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hayes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-01-12T00:00:00+01:00">January 12,
                            1943—midnight</date>.<lb/>[Received January 13—8:21 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>75. It would be helpful to me if you would let me know if you are agreeable to
                    calling Cardenas in and talking to him in the sense of my 17, January 4, 10 a.m.
                    I am delaying further representation here pending information concerning your
                    conversation in the event you concur.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hayes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
